  "label": "Anti-Black Stereotype: Cannabis Use",
  "description": "The meme relies on the stereotype that Black people are inherently associated with marijuana use, which is a harmful and reductive stereotype. This stereotype is not visible in the image but is implied by the juxtaposition of Snoop Dogg (a Black cultural icon) with the 'dark side' offering 'weed'. This association perpetuates a negative and racially charged trope.",
